        "raw": "<p>Really liking the look, too!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Now, can I see everything I want to be able to see at a glance? Not quite.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I know this may be asking a lot, but I want to be able to see everything that I can see when I&#39;m playing the game on a table. That includes things like what are both the maximum and current HP of a target and all of the cards in play (it looks like only two of a hero&#39;s cards can be shown). It also means being able to read the text of each card, though I&#39;ll admit that I can usually only do that by grabbing and reading the individual card, so something that allowed me to, for instance, touch a card to see its text might be sufficient.</p>",
